n Literary Prize, an annual literary award given to the best novel by an Asian writer, either written in English or translated into English, and published in the previous calendar year.\\n\\nFor many years, as part of The Times Literature ... \",\"title\":\"https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Booker_Prize\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":true,\"previously_received\":true,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d1\"},\"ref\":\"d1\",\"snippet\":\" ... She has translated three novels by the Italian writer Domenico Starnone, and is the editor of The Penguin Book of Italian Short Stories. A contributor for over twenty-five years toThe New Yorker magazine, she has published critical essays on authors including Ovid, Dante, Primo Levi, Alessandro Manzoni ... \",\"title\":\"https://barnard.edu/profiles/jhumpa-lahiri\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d31\"},\"ref\":\"d31\",\"snippet\":\" ... Her books have been translated into more than fifty languages and have won dozens of international awards, including the Orange Prize, the Guardian Fiction Prize, the Lannan Award for Fiction, and the Commonwealth Poetry Prize for the Americas. Among many other honours, she is a Royal … Read More ... \",\"title\":\"https://griffinpoetryprize.com/judges/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d34\"},\"ref\":\"d34\",\"snippet\":\" ... He is particularly interested in South Asian Econarratives and Anglophone novels of the 21st century. Also, he is interested in translation studies: theories and practices. He often translates English into the Bengali language. Along with academic writings, he considers himself a poet by commitment who writes Bengali poetry ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.uh.edu/class/english/programs/graduate-studies/graduate-student-directory/\"},{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d35\"},\"ref\":\"d35\",\"snippet\":\" ... Print.\\n\\n- International Society of Anglo-Saxonists [ISAS] Best First Book Publication Prize\\n\\n- Finalist for the Modern Language Association's First Book Prize\\n\\nFoys argues that early medieval culture did not favor the representational practices privileged by the modern age and that five hundred years of print culture have ... \",\"title\":\"https://english.wisc.edu/department-life/faculty-bookshelf/\"}],\"next_step\":\"Inspect navigation; read a relevant page or change the locating clue.\",\"observation\":{\"first_delivered_source_round\":null,\"prior_deliveries\":0,\"query_key\":\"18c0227b616885c40a0cd0d2770a3e5efb5df1e5b106c2cdf76c1e5525f44d5d\",\"replay_requested\":false,\"result_fingerprint\":\"e311feff5e19ab8d5af6cff90af1a8b9e9af3396beafa10c17e4cb7561a4a1e7\",\"semantic_progress\":\"not_measured\"},\"query\":\"book translated over twenty five languages Man Asian Literary Prize\",\"view\":\"full\"}]}","role":"tool","tool_call_id":"call_75842221309d41369a82a1ed"},{"content":"{\"action_slot_charged\":true,\"executed\":true,\"ok\":true,\"results\":[{\"cached\":false,\"hits\":[{\"kind\":\"navigation_not_evidence\",\"navigation_seen\":false,\"previously_received\":false,\"raw_ranges_delivered\":[],\"read_action\":{\"ref\":\"d36\"},\"ref\":\"d36\",\"snippet\":\" ... the author, most recently, of \\\"A Terrible Country\\\"; Elisabeth Jaquette, a translator and the executive director of the American Literary Translators Association; Katie Kitamura, whose most recent novel, \\\"A Separation,\\\" has been translated into sixteen languages; Idra Novey, the author of \\\"Those Who Knew,\\\" who teaches fiction at ... \",\"title\":\"https://www.newyorker.com/books/page-turner/the-2019-national-book-awards-longlist-translated-literature\"},{